<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes :  n1 The above results have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors in its meeting held on 15 May 2019.  n2 The Company primarily operates in the business of import and processing of liquified natural gas. Accordingly, there is only one Reportable Segmenl i.e.  Nalural Gas Business, hence no specific disclosures have been made w.r.t. operating segments.  n3 Previous year/period figures have been regrouped and rearranged lo make them comparable with current year/ period figures.  n4 The figures for the last quarter are the balancing figures belween the audited figures in respect of the full financial year and the published year to date figures upto the third quarter of the financial year  n5 lnventory has been marked down due to change in the market value as on the Balance Sheet. The same has resulted into decrease in valuation of invenlory and profit for the quarter and year ended 31 March 2019 by Rs 119 Crore.  n6 Formulae for computation of ratios are as follows:  nDebt Equity Ratio= Total Debt / Shareholders fund  nInterest Service Coverage Ratio = Earnings Before Interest &amp; Tax/ lnlerest Expenses for the period  nDebt service Coverage Ratio = Earnings Before Interest &amp; Tax/ (Interest Expenses for the period + Principal repayment)  n7 The Board has recommended dividend on currenl paid up capital or Rs. 1,500 Crore al Rs. 4.50 per equity share of Rs. 10 each for the year 2018-19 subject to the approval of shareholders.  n  n* Note to serial no. 32 in respect to Interest Service Coverage Ratio - The Actual Annualised Interest Service Coverage Ratio is 33.69 in place of 3.369 which is entered due to technical reasons i.e. non acceptability of double digit figure. Therefore 3.369 may be read as 33.69. </in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
